<title>RUSSIA: Russia January inflation quickens to 2.3 pct m/m.</title>
<headline>Russia January inflation quickens to 2.3 pct m/m.</headline>
<dateline>MOSCOW 1997-02-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Russian consumer prices rose by 2.3 percent month-on-month in January after a 1.4 percent rise in December 1996, the State Statistics Committee said on Wednesday.  </p>
<p>Inflation in January 1996 was 4.1 percent it said.</p>
<p>Daily inflation in January 1997 was 0.073 percent after 0.130 percent in January 1996.</p>
<p>--Moscow Newsroom, +7095 941 8520</p>
</text>
